    "description": "Settings window: the sentence under the settingsWaveformsShowTheFrequencyStack setting."
  },
  "settingsHelpWhenTheMachineCannotKeep": "Adaptive keeps time and softens the picture; every frame keeps the picture and takes the time it needs.",
